## Distance and Bearing Calculations

### Distance Between Points
```cpp
// Calculate distance between two coordinates
double calculateDistance(const QGeoCoordinate& from, const QGeoCoordinate& to)
{
    if (!from.isValid() || !to.isValid()) {
        return 0.0;
    }
    
    return from.distanceTo(to);
}
```

### Bearing Between Points
```cpp
// Calculate bearing between two coordinates
double calculateBearing(const QGeoCoordinate& from, const QGeoCoordinate& to)
{
    if (!from.isValid() || !to.isValid()) {
        return 0.0;
    }
    
    return from.azimuthTo(to);
}
```

## Error Handling Patterns

### Coordinate Calculation Errors
```cpp
// Handle calculation errors gracefully
QGeoCoordinate calculateNewCoordinates(const QGeoCoordinate& reference, 
                                     double bearing, 
                                     double distanceMeters)
{
    try {
        // Perform calculation
        return performCalculation(reference, bearing, distanceMeters);
    } catch (const std::exception& e) {
        qCWarning(MissionServiceLog) << "Coordinate calculation failed:" << e.what();
        return QGeoCoordinate();
    }
}
```

