## Performance Considerations

### Efficient Coordinate Operations
```cpp
// Use const references to avoid copying
QGeoCoordinate calculateNewCoordinates(const QGeoCoordinate& reference, 
                                     double bearing, 
                                     double distanceMeters);

// Pre-calculate constants
const double earthRadius = 6371000.0; // Earth radius in meters
const double degreesToRadians = M_PI / 180.0;
const double radiansToDegrees = 180.0 / M_PI;
```

### Batch Operations
```cpp
// Process multiple coordinates efficiently
void processCoordinates(const QList<QGeoCoordinate>& coordinates)
{
    // Reserve space to avoid reallocations
    QList<QGeoCoordinate> processed;
    processed.reserve(coordinates.size());
    
    for (const QGeoCoordinate& coord : coordinates) {
        QGeoCoordinate processedCoord = processCoordinate(coord);
        if (processedCoord.isValid()) {
            processed.append(processedCoord);
        }
    }
}
```